  "applies_to": "ABB Protronic 100/500/550 and Digitric 500 universal process controllers with the RS-485/RS-232 Modbus interface module, interface description 42/62-50040 EN Rev. 04.",
  "summary": "ABB's Protronic and Digitric panel controllers expose their internal variables to a Modbus RTU master through an interface module. Global variables (analog inputs and outputs and the per-loop controller values) are 32-bit IEEE floats in pairs of holding registers starting at register 0; online parameters and binary I/O have their own ranges. This map covers the basic and slot-1 analog I/O plus the main setpoint, process value, deviation and output values of control loops 1-4.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU"
  ],
